{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42194","headline":"贬官泰州出城作 · 徐铉","name":"贬官泰州出城作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮名浮利信悠悠，四海干戈痛主忧。\n三谏不从爲逐客，一身无累似虚舟。\n满朝权贵皆曾忤，绕郭林泉已徧游。\n惟有恋恩终不改，半程犹自望城楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}